<headline>FREE TO TRADE -- Idaho Housing and Finance Assoc.</headline>
<text>
<p>IDAHO HOUSING AND FINANCE ASSOCIATION</p>
<p>RE: $25,000,000</p>
<p>SINGLE FAMILY MORTGAGE BONDS, 1997 SERIES C</p>
